ys i.e. .html(), .append(), and others. For a card, listing representative is okay. But if the expected answer is from record, they might expect [\"html\", \"append\"]. I'll stick to explicit.\n\nCould use `[\"jQuery.fn.html\", \"jQuery.fn.append\"]` instead of `$`. Both fine. `$` is the global jQuery object. In npm, `jQuery` is exported. `$.fn.html` is the prototype method. I'd use `[\"$.fn.html\", \"$.fn.append\"]`.\n\nTrigger: \"将包含 <option> 的不可信 HTML 传入 jQuery 的 .html()/.append() 等 DOM 操作方法。\" This is one sentence. It includes config? no.\n\nsummary_zh: Need <=60 字. Let's craft concise:\n\"jQuery 3.4.1 将含 <option> 的不可信 HTML 传入 .html()/.append() 可致 XSS，升级 3.5.0。\"\nCount characters (Chinese and ASCII? \"字\" likely characters). Let's count roughly:\nJ(1) q(2) u(3) e(4) r(5) y(6) space? maybe 7? 3(8) .(9) 4(10) .(11) 1(12) space? 13 将14 含15 space? <16 o17 p18 t19 i20 o21 n22 >23 的24 不25 可26 信27 space? H28 T29 M30 L31 space? 传32 入33 space? .34 h35 t36 m37 l38 (39 )40 /41 .42 a43 p44 p45 e46 n47 d48 (49 )50 可51 致52 space? X53 S54 S55 ，56 升57 级58 space? 3(59) .(60) 5(61) .(62) 0(63) 。(64). Too long if counting ASCII. Need shorter.\n\nMaybe: \"jQuery 3.4.1 含 <option> 的不可信 HTML 经 .html()/.append() 可 XSS，升 3.5.0。\" Count: jQuery 6, space 1, 3.4.1 5, space 1, 含1, space1, <option> 8, space1, 的1, 不可信3, space1, HTML4, space1, 经1, space1, .html()/.append() 17, space1, 可1, space1, XSS3, ，1, 升1, space1, 3.5.0 5, 。1. Total maybe 60? Let's count exactly without spaces? JSON string includes spaces. We can make shorter: \"jQuery 3.4.1 用 .html()/.append() 插入含 <option> 的不可信 HTML 可 XSS，升 3.5.0。\" Count maybe similar.\n\nNeed <=60 字. In Chinese, \"字\" may mean Chinese characters, but ASCII words count? To be safe, make very short: \"jQuery 3.4.1 经 .html()/.append() 插入含 <option> 的 HTML 可 XSS，升 3.5.0。\" Count: jQuery(6) space(1) 3.4.1(5) space(1) 经(1) space(1) .html()/.append()(17) space(1) 插(1)入(1)含(1) space(1) <option>(8) space(1) 的(1) space(1) HTML(4) space(1) 可(1) space(1) XSS(3) ，(1